<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>両家顔合わせのご案内</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f3f9fd;--paper:#ffffff;--ink:#2b3a4a;--sub:#6b7d8e;--sky:#cfe6f5;--blue:#7fb2d6;--deep:#2f5f86;--line:#d5e7f3;--wave:#b9d9ee;--btn-ink:#fff;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0f1b27;--paper:#172635;--ink:#e8f1f8;--sub:#9db3c5;--sky:#2b4a63;--blue:#7fb2d6;--deep:#a9d1ec;--line:#2c4357;--wave:#27445a;--btn-ink:#0f1b27}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0f1b27;--paper:#172635;--ink:#e8f1f8;--sub:#9db3c5;--sky:#2b4a63;--blue:#7fb2d6;--deep:#a9d1ec;--line:#2c4357;--wave:#27445a;--btn-ink:#0f1b27}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Shippori Mincho","Hiragino Mincho ProN","Yu Mincho",serif;line-height:1.95;font-size:16px;word-break:keep-all;line-break:strict;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.defs{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;text-align:center;padding:40px 24px 120px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--paper) 0%,var(--bg) 100%)}
.knot{width:84px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto 6px;color:#d8403f}
.en{margin:0;letter-spacing:.35em;font-size:12px;color:var(--blue)}
h1{position:relative;margin:14px 0 14px;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,8.4vw,48px);letter-spacing:.16em;line-height:1.55;color:var(--deep)}
.families{position:relative;margin:0 0 26px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--ink)}
.families i{font-style:normal;font-size:.7em;color:var(--blue);margin:0 .8em;vertical-align:.1em}
.when{position:relative;display:inline-block;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--blue);padding:16px 34px;outline:1px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:4px}
.when .d{font-size:clamp(20px,5.6vw,28px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--deep)}
.when .t{font-size:15px;color:var(--sub);letter-spacing:.08em}
.crane{position:absolute;z-index:0;height:auto;transform:rotate(var(--r,0deg));animation:drift 8s ease-in-out infinite alternate;animation-delay:var(--dl,0s)}
@keyframes drift{to{transform:translate(12px,-10px) rotate(var(--r,0deg))}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.crane{animation:none}}
.c1{width:60px;left:5%;top:96px;--r:-10deg}
.c2{width:92px;right:4%;top:232px;--r:-6deg;--dl:-3s}
.c3{width:44px;left:12%;bottom:150px;--r:-14deg;--dl:-5s}
.waves{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:100%;height:110px;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to top,#000 30%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(to top,#000 30%,transparent)}
main{max-width:720px;margin:-24px auto 0;padding:0 18px 56px;position:relative}
.card{position:relative;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--blue);border-radius:3px;padding:34px 26px 32px;margin-bottom:24px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #7fb2d622}
.card::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:6px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;pointer-events:none}
h2{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin:0 0 20px;font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--deep);justify-content:center}
h2::before,h2::after{content:"";height:1px;flex:1;max-width:72px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--blue))}
h2::after{transform:scaleX(-1)}
h3{margin:18px 0 4px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--deep);padding-left:10px;border-left:3px solid var(--blue)}
p{margin:0 0 6px;text-wrap:pretty}
.shop{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--deep);text-align:center}
.center{text-align:center}
.sub{color:var(--sub);font-size:14px}
.map{position:relative;width:100%;height:280px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;margin-top:18px;background:var(--line)}
.btnwrap{text-align:center}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:10px 28px;background:var(--deep);color:var(--btn-ink);text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.1em}
.btn:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue);outline-offset:3px}
figure{margin:20px 0 0}
img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}
figcaption{font-size:13px;color:var(--sub);margin-top:8px;text-align:center}
.gift strong{display:block;text-align:center;font-size:22px;color:var(--deep);margin-bottom:10px;letter-spacing:.1em}
.gift p{text-align:center}
footer{position:relative;text-align:center;color:var(--sub);font-size:14px;padding:30px 20px 150px}
footer .waves{height:130px}
</style></head><body>
<svg class="defs" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
<defs>
<pattern id="sg" width="40" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
<g fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--wave)" stroke-width="1.2">
<g id="w"><circle r="20"/><circle r="14" fill="none"/><circle r="8" fill="none"/></g>
</g>
<g fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--wave)" stroke-width="1.2">
<use href="#w" x="20" y="-10"/><use href="#w" x="0" y="0"/><use href="#w" x="40" y="0"/><use href="#w" x="20" y="10"/><use href="#w" x="0" y="20"/><use href="#w" x="40" y="20"/><use href="#w" x="20" y="30"/>
</g>
</pattern>
<symbol id="crane" viewBox="0 0 100 60">
<g stroke="#7fb2d6" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round">
<polygon points="50,30 6,10 30,35" fill="#ffffff"/>
<polygon points="50,30 94,6 68,35" fill="#e4f2fb"/>
<polygon points="30,35 68,35 50,46" fill="#cfe6f5"/>
<polygon points="66,34 84,23 88,27 70,39" fill="#ffffff"/>
<polygon points="32,36 11,45 14,49 37,41" fill="#e4f2fb"/>
</g></symbol>
</defs></svg>
<header class="hero">
<svg class="knot" viewBox="0 0 120 90" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
<ellipse cx="60" cy="34" rx="27" ry="12"/><ellipse cx="60" cy="34" rx="27" ry="12" transform="rotate(60 60 34)"/><ellipse cx="60" cy="34" rx="27" ry="12" transform="rotate(120 60 34)"/>
<path d="M54 46C48 62 40 72 28 84M66 46C72 62 80 72 92 84"/>
</svg>
<svg class="crane c1" viewBox="0 0 100 60" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#crane"/></svg>
<svg class="crane c2" viewBox="0 0 100 60" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#crane"/></svg>
<svg class="crane c3" viewBox="0 0 100 60" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#crane"/></svg>
<p class="en">FAMILY GATHERING</p>
<h1>両家顔合わせの<br>ご案内</h1>
<p class="families">邑上家<i>&#9671;</i>佐々木家</p>
<div class="when"><div class="d">2026年<wbr>11月14日(土)</div><div class="t">12:00〜15:00(お席の時間)</div></div>
<svg class="waves" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#sg)"/></svg>
</header>
<main>
<section class="card">
<h2>場所</h2>
<p class="shop">鉄板薊 -Azami- 立川本店</p>
<p class="center">東京都立川市柴崎町3-6-9<wbr> GEMS立川 7階</p>
<p class="center sub">JR立川駅 南口から<wbr>徒歩2〜3分</p>
<iframe class="map" title="鉄板薊 立川本店の地図" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%E7%AB%8B%E5%B7%9D%E5%B8%82%E6%9F%B4%E5%B4%8E%E7%94%BA3-6-9+GEMS%E7%AB%8B%E5%B7%9D&output=embed"></iframe>
<div class="btnwrap"><a class="btn" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=%E9%89%84%E6%9D%BF%E8%8A%B3+Azami+%E7%AB%8B%E5%B7%9D%E6%9C%AC%E5%BA%97" target="_blank" rel="noopener">地図アプリで開く</a></div>
</section>
<section class="card">
<h2>服装について</h2>
<h3>男性</h3>
<p>ジャケット+スラックス、<wbr>またはスーツ</p>
<p class="sub">ノーネクタイでも<wbr>OKの<wbr>きれいめカジュアルです</p>
<h3>女性</h3>
<p>きれいめのワンピース、<wbr>またはブラウス+スカート<wbr>/パンツスーツ</p>
<figure><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="きれいめカジュアルの服装例。男性はカジュアルジャケットにパンツ、女性はワンピースやブラウスにボトムスなど"><figcaption>服装のイメージ(きれいめカジュアル)</figcaption></figure>
</section>
<section class="card gift">
<h2>手土産について</h2>
<strong>どなたも一切不要です</strong>
<p>両家への手土産は<wbr>新郎新婦で用意します。</p>
<p>新郎新婦への手土産も<wbr>不要です。</p>
<p style="margin-top:14px">当日は私たちから両家へ、<wbr>感謝を込めた<wbr>ささやかなギフトを<wbr>ご用意しています。</p>
</section>
</main>
<footer>当日はお気をつけて<wbr>お越しください。<br>お会いできるのを<wbr>楽しみにしています。
<svg class="waves" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#sg)"/></svg></footer>
</body></html>
